{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1470044-how-focused-on-fear-should-a-beast-be","id":1470044,"title":"How focused on Fear should a beast be?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-09T09:58:47-08:00","id":1470044,"title":"How focused on Fear should a beast be?","content":"For example: can I have a beast who is more majestic and awe inspiring and the scaryness is a side effect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T11:32:01-08:00","id":1470055,"title":"","content":"Are we just talking appearance-wise for the Horror?<br /> <br /> I mean, Beasts include things like dragons, griffins, rocs, etc. A lot of mythological monsters are very majestic and awesome, so yes.<br /> <br /> If you're <i>not</i> talking about just appearance, though<i>...</i>well, monsters are symbol sets used to contextualize fears, insecurities, forms of power, etc. that allow us to examine, understand, and accept or confront those fears, anxieties, forms of power, etc., and Beast is <i>actively</i> a game about that fact<i>, </i>so whatever else is explored with any given Beast, there's still always going to neccesarily be that element of fear. How much so is going to be vary from Beast to Beast (and game conceit to game conceit), so some are more so and others less so, but it's an <i>unavoidable</i> factor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T11:43:51-08:00","id":1470057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1470044-how-focused-on-fear-should-a-beast-be?p=1470055#post1470055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are we just talking appearance-wise for the Horror?<br /> <br /> I mean, Beasts include things like dragons, griffins, rocs, etc. A lot of mythological monsters are very majestic and awesome, so yes.<br /> <br /> If you're <i>not</i> talking about just appearance, though<i>...</i>well, monsters are symbol sets used to contextualize fears, insecurities, forms of power, etc. that allow us to examine, understand, and accept or confront those fears, anxieties, forms of power, etc., and Beast is <i>actively</i> a game about that fact<i>, </i>so whatever else is explored with any given Beast, there's still always going to neccesarily be that element of fear. How much so is going to be vary from Beast to Beast (and game conceit to game conceit), so some are more so and others less so, but it's an <i>unavoidable</i> factor.</div> </div> </div> </div>just as i suspected! thank you! and yeah,i am indeed talking about Beasts as whole","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-09T12:42:09-08:00","id":1470067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1470044-how-focused-on-fear-should-a-beast-be?p=1470057#post1470057\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">just as i suspected! thank you! and yeah,i am indeed talking about Beasts as whole</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. It's key to remember that Beast is a psychological horror game <i>about</i> our relationship to horror, what it is to live with fear and how our hunger for security is both essential and very easy to spiral out of control into negative effects, and the stories, myths, and ways of thinking we use to handle all of that.<br /> <br /> There's a lot more to it than that, and a lot of it is not so directly rooted in dealing with horror, but it is a central point to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}